        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is mission-completion third-person action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&gt;Combat is similar to TPS, but different&lt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is because you cannot use AIM!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead, you can simultaneously fire a shotgun that shoots in front of your character and an automatic tracking missile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The behavior of the missiles changes depending on the character's direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot in various directions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, you can use special  moves by consuming &quot;EN&quot;, which increases when </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >missiles are hit!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&gt;Nivoz, a fellow character&lt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nivoz, the mysterious canned robot who follows Juju around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nivoz is a mysterious canned robot that follows Juju.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also switch control to Nivoz.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also use Nivoz's bottomless durability to scout for new locations or use him as a shield...!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only while operating Nivoz, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >special shots can be activated!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of special shots </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >will increase as the game progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use each ability to your advantage and win the battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&gt;Story&lt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juju, an alien robot living on the planet Hawkia, has had a series of mishaps since the day she met </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nivoz, a robot that looks like a canned food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge building was thrust into the town where she lives, and  unfamiliar robots began to run amok.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the prototype anti-drone gun &quot;W-BLOOM&quot; in her hand, Juju's journey to find a safe place began!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is mission-completion third-person action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&gt;Combat is similar to TPS, but different&lt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is because you cannot use AIM!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead, you can simultaneously fire a shotgun that shoots in front of your character and an automatic tracking missile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The behavior of the missiles changes depending on the character's direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot in various directions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, you can use special  moves by consuming &quot;EN&quot;, which increases when </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >missiles are hit!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&gt;Nivoz, a fellow character&lt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nivoz, the mysterious canned robot who follows Juju around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nivoz is a mysterious canned robot that follows Juju.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also switch control to Nivoz.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also use Nivoz's bottomless durability to scout for new locations or use him as a shield...!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only while operating Nivoz, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >special shots can be activated!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of special shots </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >will increase as the game progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use each ability to your advantage and win the battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&gt;Story&lt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juju, an alien robot living on the planet Hawkia, has had a series of mishaps since the day she met </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nivoz, a robot that looks like a canned food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge building was thrust into the town where she lives, and  unfamiliar robots began to run amok.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the prototype anti-drone gun &quot;W-BLOOM&quot; in her hand, Juju's journey to find a safe place began!</p>",
        "short_description": "Missile attacks that automatically pursue enemies, switching control to a companion who will not be knocked down, etc. This is a third-person action game in which the player fights using slightly peculiar abilities.",
